sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Caregiver
  participant S as Med screen
  participant R as Repository
  participant D as SQLCipher DB
  participant C as Core engine
  participant N as iOS notifications
  U->>S: enters fill date and day supply
  S->>R: addFill
  R->>C: uuidv7 for the new row
  R->>D: insert med_fills row
  R->>D: append change_log row
  R-->>S: bumpDataVersion
  S->>R: useData re-reads medications
  R->>C: computeRunway with injected today
  C-->>S: runway status and days remaining
  S->>C: planNotifications with stable keys
  S->>N: getAllScheduledNotifications
  S->>N: cancel stale keys and schedule missing keys
  N-->>U: PHI free alert on the lead day
